a one-off run with a ranged batch index given no value is refused: true
that refusal names the batch index, as one: true
a retry on the same tensor runs at the value given: slice 2: true
a batch index with an inferred range, given no value, is refused too: true
and runs at the value given: slice 1: true
an unranged parameter given no value runs at 0: true
an unranged parameter runs at the value given: true
a symbolic extent given no value is refused, naming it: true
a symbolic extent runs at its full range when given it: the sum of 4 ones: true
and at a smaller value given: the sum of 2 ones: true
a value for a symbol the bindings do not bind is refused, naming it: true
a parameter given a value twice is refused, naming it: true
